<title>USA: ICF elects Hazel O'Leary to board.</title>
<headline>ICF elects Hazel O'Leary to board.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFAX, Va. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICF Kaiser International Inc said Tuesday that former U.S. Secretary of Energy Hazel O'Leary has been elected to the company's board of directors.  She currently serves on the board of directors of Africare and The Keystone Center.</p>
<p>ICF Kaiser is an engineering, construction and consulting services company.</p>
